      "statement": "The route reuses the profile snapshot it already holds for the membership verdict and folds it in with `withTenantAccess`, and combines `snapshot.status === 'sync-failed' || rosterSnapshot.status === 'sync-failed'` into one flag rendered as a `SyncFailedCallout` above both the empty branch and the populated report, so a failed roster still renders a partial, roster-blank report instead of a hidden one.",
