      "id": "claim_d96e9e4dc7fd406e80941167cd789451",
      "statement": "Both report tabs are computed client-side by pure domain functions: `computeEgaceTotals` sums stages with `enrolled` falling back to the scholar count and does not mutate its input, rates are fed `outcomeEnrolledBase` so untracked batches cannot dilute them, and employment buckets deliberately do not sum to `certified` because an unrecorded status counts as certified but lands in no bucket; `tests/unit/reports-domain.test.ts` pins all of it including the zero-denominator guards.",
