      "statement": "The export is one `—`-versus-`0` step behind the screen: `EgaceSummaryStrip` and `EgaceOutcomesTable` print an em dash for an untracked outcome stage, guarded by `hasEgaceOutcomes`, but the XLSX export carries no such guard — an untracked stage reaches the file as `0` from `egaceVal` — so a new export unit over EGACE figures must add the rule-23 distinction itself (the T2MIS sheet is unaffected because all its cells are strings).",
