      "id": "claim_7bb80d60f583446999d7d7e1be390129",
      "statement": "The T2MIS sheet is reachable only through the trainer-safe fields rule 5 requires — the layout projects `learners` plus `learner_details` (with batch facts) and carries no billing deadline, billing preparation, NTP lag or BSRS column — and ULI is the stable learner key, which is why `parseLearnerCsv` requires a `uli` header and rejects a row without one.",
